# Copy to .env.local and fill in.

# LoopLink property-search embed (CoStar/LoopNet).
# There is no public LoopNet/CoStar API and their ToS prohibits automated access,
# so the only sanctioned integration is the hosted LoopLink widget. Once you have
# an account, they provision a host like the one below; set it here and the
# property finder renders the widget instead of the local OpenStreetMap dataset.
#
# VITE_LOOPLINK_URL=https://yourfirm.looplink.com/SearchResults

# NOTE: the embed also accepts a runtime override, which is usually easier:
#   <meta name="looplink-url" content="https://yourfirm.looplink.com/SearchResults">
# in index.html, or ?looplink=<url> in the page URL for an instant test.
# Appending ?looplink= also shows a setup-check panel with your origin + headers.
